tor":-0.0499,"r20_sector":-0.0584,"etf":"XLF"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"MS 2015 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2016-01-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Gorman","x":"We acted on those things within our control by initiating a major restructuring affect, conducting a large reduction in force in December, reducing our compensation-to-revenue ratio, launching a large scale firm-wide expense initiative, more on that later, significantly reducing RWAs impact to…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2015 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2016-01-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Gorman","x":"…on those things within our control by initiating a major restructuring affect, conducting a large reduction in force in December, reducing our compensation-to-revenue ratio, launching a large scale firm-wide expense initiative, more on that later, significantly reducing RWAs impact to $136…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2016 Q2","e":"ms","d":"2016-07-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Gorman","x":"On expenses, we remain focused on our cost discipline but tactically and through project streamline.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2016 Q2","e":"ms","d":"2016-07-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Pruzan","x":"Project streamline remains on track.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2017 Q1","e":"ms","d":"2017-04-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Gorman","x":"Other priorities included achieving a wealth management pre-tax margin of 23% to 25%, delivering on project streamline and improving results across our fixed income division.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2017 Q1","e":"ms","d":"2017-04-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Pruzan","x":"I will spend a minute on our expenses and project streamline before turning to the businesses.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2017 Q2","e":"ms","d":"2017-07-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Pruzan","x":"On project streamline, virtually all identified projects are in flight and we are on-track to complete the target outlined at the start of last year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2017 Q2","e":"ms","d":"2017-07-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Pruzan","x":"During the remainder of 2017, our focus will be on completing all remaining initiatives and making sure that the culture of costs discipline represented by project streamline remains best practice.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2017 Q3","e":"ms","d":"2017-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Pruzan","x":"This is evidence that the Project Streamline expense savings initiatives we embarked on at the beginning of last year are coming to fruition.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2017 Q3","e":"ms","d":"2017-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Gorman","x":"We've hit that each quarter; efficiency ratio driven by Project Streamline of 74% expense to revenue, and we've been below that for the 3 quarters; Wealth Management margin, 23% to 25%, and we're now operating above that level; and the fourth, of course, was the Fixed Income division's revenues,…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2020 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2021-01-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"James Gorman","x":"Our fixed income franchise has well recovered from the 2015 restructuring and 2012 lows.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2020 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2021-01-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jeremy Sigee","x":"You sort of break out the amounts of acquisition related expenses in here, I just wondered if you could talk to us about the split between sort of restructuring and also ratio of intangibles?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2021 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2022-01-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"On the E*TRADE and Eaton Vance integration -- or excuse me, the Investment Management and the Eaton Vance integration, I think that the way to think about it is it wasn't ever a cost savings transaction.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2022 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2023-01-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"In the quarter, severance expenses of $133 million related to a December employee action and a net discrete tax benefit -- or net discrete tax benefits of $89 million largely offset each other through net income.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2022 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2023-01-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"We just, as you highlight through the severance, we just had a December employee action.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2023 Q2","e":"ms","d":"2023-07-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"Our early investments in technology, including data and AI, are providing advisers with tools to service current clients better and more efficiently prospect new business, including from our workplace channel.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2023 Q2","e":"ms","d":"2023-07-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"Reported results include severance charges of approximately $300 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2023 Q2","e":"ms","d":"2023-07-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"In addition to severance, expenses for the quarter included $99 million of costs associated with the integrations of E*TRADE and Eaton Vance, approximately 75% of which relates to E*TRADE.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2023 Q3","e":"ms","d":"2023-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"Together, severance and DCP impacted the year-to-date efficiency ratio by nearly 150 basis points.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2023 Q3","e":"ms","d":"2023-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"We've discussed those severance costs throughout the course of the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2023 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2024-01-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ted Pick","x":"In addition, the full year results include $353 million of severance expenses, primarily related to a May employee action.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2023 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2024-01-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ted Pick","x":"In addition, there were several expense items that impacted the margin including integration related expenses, the FDIC special assessment, severance charges and the impact of DCP, which saw meaningful swings compared to last year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2024 Q2","e":"ms","d":"2024-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"Year-to-date expenses benefited from lower litigation expenses, the absence of back office integration related costs and severance, as well as our dedicated effort to prioritize our current spend.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MS 2024 Q4","e":"ms","d":"2025-01-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Yeshaya","x":"And so yo